<div class="c4 mezon-slack">
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2" style="font-size: 20px;">&#128304;&#119820;&#119812;&#119833;&#119822;&#119821; &#119855;&#119852;
            &#119826;&#119845;&#119834;&#119836;&#119844;: &#119830;&#119815;&#119816;&#119810;&#119815;
            &#119822;&#119821;&#119812; &#119812;&#119821;&#119815;&#119808;&#119821;&#119810;&#119812;&#119826;
            &#119832;&#119822;&#119828;&#119825;
            &#119809;&#119828;&#119821;&#119826;&#119816;&#119821;&#119812;&#119826;&#119826;
            &#119810;&#119822;&#119820;&#119820;&#119828;&#119821;&#119816;&#119827;&#119816;&#119822;&#119821;?</span>
    </p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Both Mezon and Slack are powerful communication platforms, but which one is the right
            fit for your organization? Let&rsquo;s compare their key features:</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119828;&#119852;&#119834;&#119840;&#119838;</span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon is a dynamic communication platform that supports both personal and business
            interactions, making it perfect for teams, projects, and communities. It not only encourages work-related
            collaboration but also strengthens company culture and fosters social interaction, creating a dynamic and
            connected environment. Slack, however, is focused on workplace communication, offering structured
            collaboration, project management, and extensive integration with productivity tools to streamline work
            discussions.</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270;
            &#119816;&#119847;&#119853;&#119838;&#119851;&#119839;&#119834;&#119836;&#119838; &amp;
            &#119810;&#119841;&#119834;&#119847;&#119847;&#119838;&#119845;
            &#119822;&#119851;&#119840;&#119834;&#119847;&#119842;&#119859;&#119834;&#119853;&#119842;&#119848;&#119847;</span>
    </p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon offers a flexible communication experience with a combination of text and voice
            channels, optimized for real-time interactions. Its threaded discussions help organize conversations
            efficiently, making it easy to track and retrieve important information. Additionally, Mezon goes beyond
            work communication by integrating entertainment features like games, online radio, live streaming, and
            anonymous messaging, fostering a more engaging environment. In contrast, Slack structures communication
            around workspaces with dedicated channels for specific topics, focusing primarily on text-based messaging
            and deep integrations with enterprise productivity tools.</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119829;&#119848;&#119842;&#119836;&#119838; &amp;
            &#119829;&#119842;&#119837;&#119838;&#119848;
            &#119810;&#119834;&#119845;&#119845;&#119842;&#119847;&#119840;</span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon provides unlimited voice and video calling with seamless Google Meet
            integration, allowing users to create voice chat rooms for both one-on-one and group discussions without
            restrictions. This ensures smooth and flexible communication, whether for work or casual conversations.
            Meanwhile, Slack limits free users to one-on-one calls, requiring a paid upgrade for group calls, making it
            less accessible for teams needing frequent voice or video collaboration..</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119827;&#119848;&#119848;&#119845;
            &#119816;&#119847;&#119853;&#119838;&#119840;&#119851;&#119834;&#119853;&#119842;&#119848;&#119847;&#119852;</span>
    </p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon offers robust integration with ERP tools for seamless project management
            through Mezon Apps, allowing direct interaction within chats. It also supports low-code bot creation, AI
            agents, and a wide range of features, including games and tools designed for community engagement. On the
            other hand, Slack focuses on enhancing work efficiency with integrations like Google Workspace, Microsoft
            Office, Trello, and Asana. However, many advanced integrations are locked behind paid plans, limiting access
            to essential tools for free-tier users.</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119826;&#119838;&#119836;&#119854;&#119851;&#119842;&#119853;&#119858;
            &amp; &#119823;&#119851;&#119842;&#119855;&#119834;&#119836;&#119858;</span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon is designed to cater to open communities, offering high security with flexible
            access controls to ensure both safety and privacy. It balances openness with robust protection, making it
            suitable for diverse groups. Slack, in comparison, offers enterprise-grade security with encrypted data
            protection, making it ideal for corporate environments that need to manage sensitive information
            securely.</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119823;&#119851;&#119842;&#119836;&#119842;&#119847;&#119840;</span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">Mezon offers a completely free service for both personal and business use, with no
            feature restrictions, making it an accessible and versatile platform for everyone. In contrast, Slack&#39;s
            free plan has some limitations, including message storage for only 90 days and a cap of 10 integrations. To
            unlock additional features, such as unlimited message history and more integrations, users must opt for a
            paid plan, starting at $7.25 per user/month.</span></p>
    <p class="c0 c1"><span class="c2"></span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">&#128270; &#119830;&#119841;&#119842;&#119836;&#119841; &#119822;&#119847;&#119838;
            &#119826;&#119841;&#119848;&#119854;&#119845;&#119837; &#119832;&#119848;&#119854;
            &#119810;&#119841;&#119848;&#119848;&#119852;&#119838;?</span></p>
    <p class="c0"><span class="c2">If you&rsquo;re looking for a free, interactive, and community-driven platform with
            strong voice chat and entertainment features, Mezon is an excellent choice. However, Slack may be the better
            fit if you need a structured business communication tool with enterprise-grade security and deep
            productivity integrations.</span></p>
